  "body": "Forget the car and lose the shoes. At 1/357 Hibiscus Coast Highway, your back gate opens to the beach walking track and down to the sand. While your front door is just moments from Orewa's best coffee. This is a rare opportunity to secure a coastal retreat in a location that puts the beach and the township at your absolute fingertips.\r\n\r\nStep inside and be immediately wowed by the light-filled, open-plan sanctuary. This isn't your average Lockwood - it has been stylishly renovated blending timeless character with a sleek design. The heart of the home is the stunning kitchen, which flows effortlessly into a spacious living area where double glazing and a heat pump ensure year-round comfort.\r\n\r\nDesigned for the ultimate entertainer, the living space features sliding doors that open to private patios on both sides. Positioned to capture the sun from dawn 'til dusk, these outdoor spaces are perfect for alfresco dining, summer cocktails, or simply relaxing after a morning surf.\r\n\r\nTwo Generous Bedrooms: Spacious serviced by two bathrooms.\r\n\r\nExtra features: A single carport complemented by a secure shed - perfect for housing the surfboards, bikes, and beach gear. The property is also fully fenced with an electric gate.\r\n\r\nLocation is the true luxury here. With private legal access directly onto the new walking track and down to the sands of Orewa Beach, your morning stroll or kayak session is just moments away. When you aren't on the water, you are only a short flat walk from the vibrant cafes, restaurants, and boutique shopping in the Orewa township. You are perfectly connected to the very best of the coast.\r\n\r\nOpportunities to own a property like this don't come around often. Whether you are looking for a sophisticated downsize, a lock-and-leave, or a beachside base, this property delivers on every front.\r\n\r\nContact us today for a full information pack and experience the magic for yourself.",
